{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash the chills with the Horror Pack for Color-A-Cube!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to color in the dark with this fright-filled DLC featuring 10 spine-tingling models that bring your worst voxel  nightmares to life. From haunted houses to cursed dolls, each design is packed with eerie details and plenty of voxels to color. The Horror Pack invites you to create terror one cube at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included Models &amp; Voxel Counts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Monster Under Bed \u2013 1,464 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf8 Voodoo Doll \u2013 1,047 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc12 Monkey toy \u2013 856 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b55Summoning Circle \t- 1385 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 Bloody Mary \u2013 1,664 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Ouija Board \u2013 4,104 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Haunted House \u2013 6,723 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26b0\ufe0f Gravestone Zombie Hand \u2013 10,009 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd21 Clown Head \u2013 1,179 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Mothman \u2013 1,086 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness and give fear a fresh color with the Horror Pack!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065150?t=1759408115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065150?t=1759408115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065150/5c7cf91ee86231b4660bb1ce93bb8bcb1fc8f708/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759408115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065150/5c7cf91ee86231b4660bb1ce93bb8bcb1fc8f708/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759408115","categories":[{"description":"Single